WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 90s v1.0 — ai-reads-human (ig) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:18.392
<v Narrator>Nke mbụ, kọmputa na-atụgharị data n'ime usoro iheomume ngwe nke e dere maka anya mmadụ, na-egbochi igwe iji nweta ọrụ ọzọ. Nke abụọ, ịgụ ngwe nhazi nke akọwapụtara na-ewe ọtụtụ puku ugboro karịa ike chip karịa ịgụ nọmba igwe dị mfe.

2
00:00:18.472 --> 00:00:27.963
<v Narrator>Nke atọ, ịkpụzi ngwe nke ejiri aka mee ihe n'ime okwu AI na-ekpo ọkụ ugboro iri abụọ karịa ike karịa ka ọ dị na ngwe ahụ.

3
00:00:28.043 --> 00:00:48.767
<v Narrator>Formats zuru ezu nke curly braces, commas, na indentated spaces e mere ka ndị mmadụ nwee ike ịhụ faịlụ n'ụzọ dị mfe na ngwe editors. Ma AI ngwaọrụ pipelines ọhụrụ gafere ndepụta ndị a na-akọwapụtaghị aha site na igwe gaa na igwe na-enweghị onye ọ bụla na-ahụkarị.

4
00:00:48.847 --> 00:01:10.599
<v Narrator>Anyị kpọrọ ọrụ a na-arụ ọrụ nke impedance tax ma nyochaa ihe karịrị iri atọ na anọ na-enyocha na okwu-split workloads n'elu puku abụọ narị nde. Na-agba ọsọ oge ọ bụla n'ime usoro ọrụ dị iche iche na Apple processor na-eme ka ọnụ ahịa parsing dị ala site na ọrụ laptọọpụ nzuzo.

5
00:01:10.679 --> 00:01:34.567
<v Narrator>Unpacking a twenty-three-byte binary record ejirila abụọ narị narị narị nanojoules. Standard bracketed ngwe ejiwokwa ihe dị ka ugboro asaa karịa, compiled indented ngwe ejiwokwa ugboro abụọ narị narị narị narị naịra karịa, na pure Python indented ngwe ebipụtara ugboro abụọ narị narị anọ karịa chip ike.

6
00:01:34.647 --> 00:01:51.890
<v Narrator>Ọbụna na-agbakwunye ebe abụọ nke n'ime ihe dị mma karịa ka ọ bụrụ AI okwu-splittering ike ruo iri na otu microjoules kwa rekọ. Kwụsị imewe igwe na-agbaze ma ọ bụ binary, nakwa ngwe formatted naanị mgbe ndị mmadụ na-agụ.
